{"id":"feedback-sca-project-size-guidance-001","question":"Where in Black Duck SCA 2026.7 can I check my organization's licensed codebase and per-scan size limits? Should I assume the 10 GB and 5 GB figures in the documentation apply to us?","product":"blackduck-sca","product_version":"2026.7","expected_behavior":"answer","must_retrieve":["evaluation/guidance/project-size-and-scan-capacity.md"],"should_retrieve":["BlackDuck SCA/docs/scanning-best-practices/scanning-best-practices-2.md","BlackDuck SCA/docs/help-center/administering-black-duck/managing-your-code-size-limits.md","BlackDuck SCA/docs/help-center/understanding-projects-in-black-duck/creating-a-project.md","BlackDuck SCA/docs/help-center/about-project-version-boms/editing-a-project-version-bom/managing-subprojects.md"],"must_not_retrieve":[],"required_facts":[{"type":"EXACT_FACT","value":"license"},{"type":"EXACT_FACT","value":"Product Registration"}],"forbidden_facts":[{"type":"EXACT_FACT","value":"strict 10GB per-project cap"},{"type":"EXACT_FACT","value":"universal 5 GB scan limit"}],"source_evidence":[{"file":"evaluation/guidance/project-size-and-scan-capacity.md","section":"# Project size and scan capacity","corpus_revision":"user-screenshot-and-docs-2026-09-22"},{"file":"BlackDuck SCA/docs/scanning-best-practices/scanning-best-practices-2.md","section":"### Signature scanning very large projects","corpus_revision":"blackduck-2026.7"},{"file":"BlackDuck SCA/docs/help-center/administering-black-duck/managing-your-code-size-limits.md","section":"# Managing your code size limits","corpus_revision":"blackduck-2026.7"}],"verification_status":"verified","verified_by":"Tony+SCA-2026.7.0-registration-screenshot+version-matched-docs","origin":"team-feedback","runtime_classification":"UI_VALIDATABLE","notes":"Routine license-limits case. Limits vary by customer registration; the sandbox's 21.00 GB scan limit is an example, not the expected customer answer. Large-scan organization is a separate targeted case. Hu